abstract: >-
  Document corpus, check scripts and formal Lean 4 proofs of the Fundamental
  Fractal Geometric Field Theory (FFGFT): a ratio-based theory with a single
  dimensionless parameter xi = 4/30000 on a compact 4D torus T4/Z3 and the
  fundamental relation T*m = 1.
keywords:
  - FFGFT
  - time-mass duality
  - Lean 4
  - Galois fields
